      "content": "but it doesn't feel like a hallucination. it feels way too real. like, the heat signatures are actually distinct and have different colors. i've been reading a lot about how certain people experience heightened sensory awareness during major evolutionary shifts in the species. if this isn't a medical issue, how do i manage it so it doesnt become overwhelming? is there a way to stabilize these new perceptions so i can actually function?",
